      "content": "i hear you but it feels so scripted... like you're just saying what you have to say. but honestly, when everything is this broken, doesn't \"hope\" just feel like more work? like i'm just being told to keep struggling in a cycle that never actually gets better. it feels more like a burden than a reason to keep going.",
